   "szLabel": "Phase0Description",
   "szText": "I should travel to Tarsarak to meet with Sayeena at her shop. She said she would explain more about what occurred in the crypt with Belial.",
   "hLabel": 3577478917
  },
  {
   "__type__": "StringTableEntry",
   "__typeHash__": 3844612145,
   "szLabel": "Phase5Description",
